        "service_DcCJaQ": {
          "type": "service",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Brand_Identity_3.webp",
            "popup_image": "shopify://shop_images/Web_Design_Developnment_1.webp",
            "title": "Brand Identity",
            "category": "digital-marketing",
            "short_description": "",
            "full_description": "At PackTHC Studio, we get it. Whether it’s the logo, the fonts, or the words right there on your packaging, we help your cannabis brand stand out. You won’t just get noticed—you’ll stay on everyone’s mind and at the front of the shelf. We’re all about working together. Show up with a half-formed idea or a detailed plan—either way, we’ll help you shape a creative direction that ties your look, packaging, and voice together everywhere your brand shows up.",
            "features": "Stand Out in a Saturated Market + | Aligned, Long-Term Vision + | Built Around Your Customer +",
            "faqs": "Stand Out in a Saturated Market | Let’s face it—cannabis shelves are packed. Your brand identity is what helps you break through the noise. When you show up with a look and voice that actually mean something, customers notice. || Aligned, Long-Term Vision | Get clear on what you stand for—your mission, purpose, and values—so your customers and team move in the same direction. || Built Around Your Customer | When your brand connects with what people believe in, you don’t just get attention—you build loyalty.",
            "tabs": "Collaborative Vision | We’re all about working together. Show up with a half-formed idea or a detailed plan—either way, we’ll help you shape a creative direction that ties your look, packaging, and voice together everywhere your brand shows up. || Personality-Driven Branding | Design catches the eye, sure. But when you add some personality? That’s when people start buying. We mix your style with messaging that feels true to you, so your customers hit “add to cart” without a second thought. || Naming & Taglines | Naming a cannabis brand isn’t easy—there’s gut instinct, legal stuff, and just plain taste. We’ll brainstorm with you, test ideas, and land on names and taglines that feel right for you and instantly click with your crowd.",
            "link": "shopify://pages/contact"
          }
        },
